# =============================================================================
# restmap.conf.cloud
#
# For Splunk Cloud deployments: rename this file to restmap.conf and
# delete (or rename) the existing restmap.conf.
#
# No custom REST handlers are registered. All app functionality runs through:
#   • Native KV Store REST API (/storage/collections/data/*)
#   • SPL macros using inputlookup / outputlookup
#   • Scheduled saved searches
#   • Client-side React logic in the browser
# =============================================================================
